mon look like a mid-boss. RelicsWe're adding a new layer of strategy with Relics. Fishy will now offer you a Relic at the start of your run that will switch up ideas for builds. They're also handing out a quick revive for players who pr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:58:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690086","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1846018067933891","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Soon","summary":"Hey all!Hope you've all been enjoying the demo and thank you to everyone for playing! Steam Next Fest is starting on the 19th of October and we're preparing a major demo update that will go live at 19:00 CEST / 10:00 PDT. We wanted to show you a bit more of what we have in store for the full launch. In the Next Fest demo:Rivals (asynchronous multiplayer)Encounter other player's castle instead of demon bosses. Get ready for some of your toughest battles. It will make the Archdemon look like a mid","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:21:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1842846814445971","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update","summary":"Thanks for playing the demo everyone! We received a lot of valuable feedback. Some of the smaller changes are addressed in this small update. In the meantime we are also hard at work on the bigger features!Improved combat clarity with expanded enemy information, better tooltip positioning, and clearer hit feedback.Burn and poison now wait for their full duration before dealing their first damage tick.Fixed an issue where very fast structures could stop activating.Improved early encounter placeme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T10:14:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445971","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1841579228675703","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"Hey all! You can play the Castle Away Demo RIGHT NOW! Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted, playtested, streamed, and followed along. We have spent the last three months iterating on the game's design, and balancing the content to hopefully create a tight demo experience, in which you can craft multiple builds on two unique castle grids. In the demo:2 Regions – explore the Cradle and the Steppes. 2 Factions – experiment with the Stone and Dirt castle grids. 2 Difficulties – were you able to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T14:33:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1840944183788110","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out on August 24","summary":"Hey everybody :)We're very happy to announce that we've got a demo ready for Castle Away! We'll get it into your hands in a few days, so get ready to design your own flying castle! We'll explain everything that's in the demo and what else we've been working on in our next update here on Steam.Thanks for following along!René, Sim, Matthijs & Tom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T07:58:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788110","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1831432155578093","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Extended through Deckbuilders Fest","summary":"Hey all!We received a great amount of responses to our first playtest of Castle Away, and we're super happy with all the suggestions, feedback and comments on the current build. We've been checking out all feedback, and we’ve just pushed a pretty big update to the build!To give everyone time to try out the new features, we are keeping the playtest open until May 11th, 10AM PDT / 7PM CEST.New in this build:Mac & Linux Native Support: Castle Away is heading to Linux and Mac! Players can now try ou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T17:04:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1830163047266707","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Playtest during Medieval Fest","summary":"Hey all!We've been happily tinkering away at the game loop with the feedback from our playtesters in the Renegade Games Discord. And we're now at a point where we'd love to get input from everyone interested in Castle Away, including you!Since announcing the project 5 weeks ago, we were able to gather a lot of input from playtesters and streamers, which will hopefully have resulted in a smoother onboarding and overall balanced experience.This version of the game still only has about 20-30% of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T17:02:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047266707","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4362480-1826992588592551","game_id":"steam-4362480","kind":"announcement","title":"Castle Away just announced!","summary":"Hey all!We’re excited to finally announce Castle Away! Playtest signups are now open for members of the Renegade Games Discord, and we can’t wait for you to get your first look.The trailer and screenshots should give you a sense of the core gameplay loop: explore → battle → expand. There’s still plenty ahead of us in terms of content, though.The current build includes about a third of the content we’re planning for the full release. Your feedback during the playtests will help us refine the main","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T14:26:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588592551","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4362480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4362480":"2026-10-26T12:08:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4362480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:57Z"},"5065010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4362480","app_id":4362480,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2ebcf9558592551bd26